diff --git a/.env.example b/.env.example
index add46ad..c6e84e6 100644
--- a/.env.example
+++ b/.env.example
@@ -22,6 +22,10 @@ VOICE_TURN_TOKEN=your-voice-turn-bearer-token
 # ── device gateway / transport ───────────────────────────────────────
 # MCP endpoint of the stackchan device gateway (stackchan-mcp).
 #STACKCHAN_MCP_URL=http://127.0.0.1:8767/mcp
+# Bearer token accepted by that MCP endpoint. Set this when the device gateway
+# has STACKCHAN_TOKEN/BEARER_TOKEN configured; it is independent of the brain's
+# VOICE_TURN_TOKEN.
+#STACKCHAN_MCP_TOKEN=
 # JSONL event stream the gateway writes (touch events are read from here).
 # Must match the gateway's configured event log path.
 #STACKCHAN_EVENTS_JSONL=~/.stackchan/events.jsonl
@@ -51,7 +55,7 @@ VOICE_TURN_TOKEN=your-voice-turn-bearer-token
 # (common for short noisy clips) retries forced to the FIRST entry.
 # Empty = trust detection. (Long captures are exempt — third-party speech
 # is transcribed in whatever language it detects.)
-#COMPANION_STT_LANGUAGES=en
+COMPANION_STT_LANGUAGES=zh
 # Discard transcripts containing any of these substrings — whisper's
 # near-silence hallucinations are watermark-shaped (subtitle credits from
 # training data). One gate, applied after both local and remote STT.
diff --git a/README.en.md b/README.en.md
index 077151b..1e47275 100644
--- a/README.en.md
+++ b/README.en.md
@@ -558,6 +558,7 @@ with longer commentary. Only `VOICE_TURN_URL` is required.
 | `COMPANION_VIA` | `local` | transport label sent with each turn (network fingerprint) |
 | **device gateway** | | |
 | `STACKCHAN_MCP_URL` | `http://127.0.0.1:8767/mcp` | device gateway MCP endpoint |
+| `STACKCHAN_MCP_TOKEN` | empty | Bearer for the device gateway MCP endpoint; match its `STACKCHAN_TOKEN`, independently of the brain's `VOICE_TURN_TOKEN` |
 | `STACKCHAN_EVENTS_JSONL` | `~/.stackchan/events.jsonl` | gateway's JSONL event stream (touch events) |
 | `STACKCHAN_DEVICE_ID` | empty | free-form device id included in turns |
 | **HTTP surface** | | |
@@ -569,7 +570,7 @@ with longer commentary. Only `VOICE_TURN_URL` is required.
 | `WHISPER_REMOTE_URL` | empty | remote STT tried first, silent fallback to local |
 | `WHISPER_REMOTE_TOKEN` | empty | Bearer for remote STT |
 | `WHISPER_REMOTE_TIMEOUT_S` | `4` | remote STT timeout |
-| `COMPANION_STT_LANGUAGES` | empty | expected languages; off-list detection retries as the first (long captures exempt) |
+| `COMPANION_STT_LANGUAGES` | `zh` | expected languages; off-list detection retries as the first (long captures exempt) |
 | `COMPANION_STT_HALLUCINATIONS` | watermark set | discard transcripts containing any of these substrings (whisper's near-silence watermarks) |
 | **speech output** | | |
 | `COMPANION_SAY_VOICE` | empty | voice name for the say tool (empty = device default) |
